  "description": "<p>Touch; casting takes <strong>10 minutes</strong>.</p><ul><li>One willing dead creature, dead no longer than 10 years per level, of which you hold at least a piece of the body (the spell restores the rest).</li><li>It returns with half its maximum HP, 2 levels of Exhaustion and no spells prepared, with no Constitution loss.</li><li>Fails if the creature died of old age. No save.</li><li>Material: diamond dust worth 1,000 gp, consumed.</li></ul><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Costly component:</strong> see Rare Spell Components in the Shopkeeper's Catalogue.</p><p class=\"arn-note\"><strong>Classes:</strong> Cleric</p>",
